    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7232" root="حجم" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْجَمَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْجَمٌ</span></b>  The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَارُورَة</span> [or <i>glass vessel,</i>
or <i>the like,</i>] <i>of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجَّام</span>; (Az, S, Mgh, Msb;)
the <i>thing with which the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجَّام</span> <i>operates;</i> (K;)
the <i>utensil in which the blood produced by the
operation of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِجَامَة</span> <i>is collected by sucking:</i> (IAth,
TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَاجِمُ</span>. (TA.)

